      </div>
    </section>
<section id="section-silent" data-page="controls" class="card span-all">
<h2>1. 群聊总开关</h2><p id="replySwitchStatus" role="status"></p>
<div class="row"><button id="silentOff">开启群聊</button><button id="silentOn">关闭全部群聊</button></div>
<p class="meta">开启：使用下方高峰／闲时规则，每种召唤和巡游入口分别控制。关闭：所有群都不回复，主人在群里艾特也不回，仅保留主人私聊。会取消相关群聊任务，保留历史与记忆。</p>
<p class="meta">没有跨时段待回复功能。被总开关或时段策略拦住的艾特不会在开启后补回；仅保留原有的忙碌中临时唤醒队列。</p>
<p class="meta">仅控制 qq-bridge，不控制 AstrBot。白名单、安全限制和工具权限仍生效。</p>
<div id="masterSchedulePanel" style="grid-column:1/-1;width:100%;margin-top:16px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">
<h3>总开关定时控制</h3>
<form id="masterScheduleForm">
<div class="row"><label for="masterScheduleEnabled">启用每日定时</label><input id="masterScheduleEnabled" type="checkbox" style="width:auto"></div>
<div class="row" style="margin-top:10px"><label for="masterScheduleStart">自动开启（北京时间）</label><input id="masterScheduleStart" type="time" style="max-width:170px"><label for="masterScheduleEnd">自动关闭（北京时间）</label><input id="masterScheduleEnd" type="time" style="max-width:170px"></div>
<p class="meta">每天重复。支持跨午夜，例如 18:00 开启、次日 09:00 关闭；其余时间群聊总开关保持关闭。开启和关闭时间不能相同。</p>
<p class="meta">保存并启用后，立即按当前时间调整总开关；关闭定时会保留当时的开关状态。手动切换总开关会自动停用定时。定时开启后仍受高峰／闲时响应规则限制，主人私聊不受影响。</p>
<div class="row"><button type="submit">保存定时设置</button><span id="masterScheduleMsg" class="meta" role="status"></span></div>
<p id="masterScheduleStatus" class="meta" role="status">定时未启用：总开关由你手动控制。</p>
</form></div>
</section>
<section id="section-group-policy" data-page="controls" class="card span-all"><h2>2. 高峰／闲时群聊规则</h2><p id="groupPolicyStatus" role="status"></p><p class="meta">勾选表示允许此类触发；除主人真实艾特外，模型仍根据语境决定是否回复。总开关关闭时，下方所有群聊权限均不生效。</p><form id="groupPolicyForm"><div style="overflow-x:auto"><table style="width:100%"><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left">触发类型</th><th>高峰</th><th>闲时（半价）</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="padding:10px 6px">主人真实艾特<div class="meta">根据真实 QQ 账号识别，不以昵称或自称代替</div></td><td style="text-align:center"><input id="gp-peak-ownerAtMention" type="checkbox" aria-label="高峰：主人真实艾特" style="width:auto"></td><td style="text-align:center"><input id="gp-offPeak-ownerAtMention" type="checkbox" aria-label="闲时：主人真实艾特" style="width:auto"></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 6px">普通群友艾特<div class="meta">允许唤醒后按语境选择性回应</div></td><td style="text-align:center"><input id="gp-peak-memberAtMention" type="checkbox" aria-label="高峰：普通群友艾特" style="width:auto"></td><td style="text-align:center"><input id="gp-offPeak-memberAtMention" type="checkbox" aria-label="闲时：普通群友艾特" style="width:auto"></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 6px">引用机器人消息<div class="meta">任何人只引用、未艾特时使用此项</div></td><td style="text-align:center"><input id="gp-peak-quoteReply" type="checkbox" aria-label="高峰：引用机器人消息" style="width:auto"></td><td style="text-align:center"><input id="gp-offPeak-quoteReply" type="checkbox" aria-label="闲时：引用机器人消息" style="width:auto"></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 6px">文字召唤（名字／关键词）<div class="meta">包括主人在内；不带真实艾特的叫名字也受此项控制</div></td><td style="text-align:center"><input id="gp-peak-textWake" type="checkbox" aria-label="高峰：文字召唤（名字／关键词）" style="width:auto"></td><td style="text-align:center"><input id="gp-offPeak-textWake" type="checkbox" aria-label="闲时：文字召唤（名字／关键词）" style="width:auto"></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 6px">当前话题续聊<div class="meta">允许原对话人在观察窗口内不艾特接话，仍选择性回复</div></td><td style="text-align:center"><input id="gp-peak-followup" type="checkbox" aria-label="高峰：当前话题续聊" style="width:auto"></td><td style="text-align:center"><input id="gp-offPeak-followup" type="checkbox" aria-label="闲时：当前话题续聊" style="width:auto"></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 6px">有人聊天时抽样巡游<div class="meta">使用下方抽样概率与冷却参数</div></td><td style="text-align:center"><input id="gp-peak-ambientSampling" type="checkbox" aria-label="高峰：有人聊天时抽样巡游" style="width:auto"></td><td style="text-align:center"><input id="gp-offPeak-ambientSampling" type="checkbox" aria-label="闲时：有人聊天时抽样巡游" style="width:auto"></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 6px">安静时主动检查<div class="meta">使用下方检查间隔、空闲阈值与概率</div></td><td style="text-align:center"><input id="gp-peak-idleProactive" type="checkbox" aria-label="高峰：安静时主动检查" style="width:auto"></td><td style="text-align:center"><input id="gp-offPeak-idleProactive" type="checkbox" aria-label="闲时：安静时主动检查" style="width:auto"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="row" style="margin-top:12px"><button type="submit">保存时段响应规则</button><span class="meta" id="groupPolicyMsg" role="status"></span></div></form><p class="meta">默认高峰只开启主人真实艾特；闲时全部允许，巡游仍受概率、冷却及唤醒频率限制。取消一种召唤后，它不会改从抽样入口绕过。</p></section>
<section id="section-peak-controls" data-page="controls" class="card span-all"><h2>3. 峰谷时间表</h2><form id="scheduleControlsForm">
<div class="row"><label for="sc-enabled">启用峰谷分段</label><input type="checkbox" id="sc-enabled" style="width:auto"></div>
<p class="meta">北京时间。启用后，按此时间表选择高峰／闲时响应规则；已核实的法定节假日全天按闲时。关闭峰谷分段表示全天使用闲时规则，并不关闭群聊。主人私聊的被动回复不受此分段影响。</p><div class="row"><label for="sc-day-1">周一</label><input id="sc-day-1" type="checkbox" style="width:auto"><label for="sc-day-2">周二</label><input id="sc-day-2" type="checkbox" style="width:auto"><label for="sc-day-3">周三</label><input id="sc-day-3" type="checkbox" style="width:auto"><label for="sc-day-4">周四</label><input id="sc-day-4" type="checkbox" style="width:auto"><label for="sc-day-5">周五</label><input id="sc-day-5" type="checkbox" style="width:auto"><label for="sc-day-6">周六</label><input id="sc-day-6" type="checkbox" style="width:auto"><label for="sc-day-7">周日</label><input id="sc-day-7" type="checkbox" style="width:auto"></div><div class="row" style="margin-top:8px"><label for="sc-start-0">高峰时段1</label><input id="sc-start-0" type="time" required><span>至</span><input id="sc-end-0" type="time" aria-label="高峰结束1" required></div><div class="row" style="margin-top:8px"><label for="sc-start-1">高峰时段2</label><input id="sc-start-1" type="time" required><span>至</span><input id="sc-end-1" type="time" aria-label="高峰结束2" required></div><p class="meta" id="scheduleCalendarInfo"></p><p class="meta">群内艾特、文字召唤、续聊和巡游，都由上方对应时段的勾选项决定。主人私聊自主活动继续遵守原有时段限制。</p><button type="submit">保存峰谷设置</button><span class="meta" id="scheduleControlsMsg" role="status"></span></form></section>
<section id="section-conversation-controls" data-page="controls" class="card span-all"><h2>4. 群聊续聊与唤醒</h2>
<p class="meta">以上时段规则允许响应后，才使用这些节奏参数。连续检测不代表每句都回复，也不会绕过高峰或总开关限制。仅保存时生效，单位为秒。</p>
<form id="groupControlsForm"><div class="row"><label for="gc-enabled">启用群聊节奏预算（分条／回合限制）</label><input id="gc-enabled" type="checkbox" style="width:auto"><label for="gc-continuousReplies">连续接话观察（受上方时段权限限制）</label><input id="gc-continuousReplies" type="checkbox" style="width:auto"></div><div class="row" style="margin-top:8px"><label for="gc-conversationIdleMs" style="flex:1">无相关接话后潜水（秒）</label><input id="gc-conversationIdleMs" type="number" required min="1" max="600" step="1" style="max-width:180px"></div><div class="row" style="margin-top:8px"><label for="gc-autonomousCooldownMs" style="flex:1">主动参与冷却（秒）</label><input id="gc-autonomousCooldownMs" type="number" required min="0" max="3600" step="1" style="max-width:180px"></div><div class="row" style="margin-top:8px"><label for="gc-sampleProbability" style="flex:1">无点名时话题抽样概率（%）</label><input id="gc-sampleProbability" type="number" required min="0" max="100" step="1" style="max-width:180px"></div><div class="row" style="margin-top:8px"><label for="gc-maxMessagesPerTurn" style="flex:1">每次回应最多分条</label><input id="gc-maxMessagesPerTurn" type="number" required min="1" max="8" step="1" style="max-width:180px"></div><div class="row" style="margin-top:8px"><label for="gc-directWakeBatchMs" style="flex:1">普通点名合并等待（秒）</label><input id="gc-directWakeBatchMs" type="number" required min="1" max="8" step="0.25" style="max-width:180px"></div><div class="row" style="margin-top:8px"><label for="gc-ownerWakeBatchMs" style="flex:1">哥哥艾特合并等待（秒）</label><input id="gc-ownerWakeBatchMs" type="number" required min="1" max="8" step="0.25" style="max-width:180px"></div><div class="row" style="margin-top:8px"><label for="gc-followupQuietMs" style="flex:1">接话消息合并静默（秒）</label><input id="gc-followupQuietMs" type="number" required min="0.25" max="30" step="0.25" style="max-width:180px"></div><div class="row" style="margin-top:8px"><label for="gc-maxTurnMs" style="flex:1">普通唤醒首次处理预算（秒）</label><input id="gc-maxTurnMs" type="number" required min="10" max="600" step="1" style="max-width:180px"></div><div class="row" style="margin-top:8px"><label for="gc-ownerMaxTurnMs" style="flex:1">哥哥唤醒首次处理预算（秒）</label><input id="gc-ownerMaxTurnMs" type="number" required min="10" max="600" step="1" style="max-width:180px"></div><div class="row" style="margin-top:8px"><label for="gc-closeAfterSendMs" style="flex:1">非连续模式发送后收尾（秒）</label><input id="gc-closeAfterSendMs" type="number" required min="1" max="600" step="1" style="max-width:180px"></div><p class="meta">抽样概率只是主动话题的候选唤醒，模型仍要判断是否插话；不影响真实艾特。连续模式下，发送后收尾参数不生效，以无接话时长为准。</p><button type="submit">保存续聊与唤醒设置</button><span class="meta" id="groupControlsMsg" role="status"></span></form></section>

<section id="section-proactive-controls" data-page="controls" class="card span-all"><h2>5. 安静时主动检查参数</h2><p class="meta">群聊是否主动检查，只看上方时段规则中的勾选。以下是检查的时机参数，保留原来的数值；这些间隔同时用于原有主人私聊主动检查。程序定时检查本身不调用模型，通过空闲、概率和权限判断后才会唤醒模型。</p><form id="proactiveControlsForm">
      <div class="row">
        <label style="flex:1">主人私聊主动检查（原有独立设置）</label><input type="checkbox" id="v2ProactiveEnabled" style="width:auto">
        <label style="flex:1">检查间隔（分）</label>
        <input type="number" id="v2ProactiveIntervalMin" min="1" style="width:80px"> ~
        <input type="number" id="v2ProactiveIntervalMax" min="1" style="width:80px">
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <label style="flex:1">安静阈值（分）</label><input type="number" id="v2ProactiveIdleThreshold" min="1" style="width:80px">
        <label style="flex:1">触发概率</label><input type="number" id="v2ProactiveProbability" step="0.05" min="0" max="1" style="width:80px">
      </div>

      <button type="submit">保存主动检查参数</button><span class="meta" id="proactiveControlsMsg" role="status"></span></form></section><section id="section-switch-shortcut" data-page="overview" class="card span-all"><h2>群聊开关</h2><p class="meta">总开关、高峰／闲时响应规则、峰谷时间表和续聊参数已集中到左侧“开关控制”。</p><a class="button" href="#controls">前往开关控制</a></section><section id="section-dsh" data-page="overview" class="card span-all">
      <h2 data-note="下一条消息生效">DSH 模型与思考强度</h2>
      <div class="meta">模型：<span id="dshModelText">-</span> ｜ 提供方：<span id="dshProviderText">-</span></div>
